able Tiberium Silos","pog":"m10_2_07","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"Disabling the Nod Tiberium Silos will hamper Nod production in this base facility. Destroy the Nod Tiberium Silos.","x":75.45,"y":52.07,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Acquire Base Security Card","pog":"m10_1_08","type":"Main","action":"Acquire","text":"A series of gates prevents the GDI assault team from progressing into the Nod base. A security card to open these gates will most likely be found inside the Nod Tiberium Refinery.","x":46.78,"y":52.84,"floor":2},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable Northern Helipad","pog":"m10_2_06","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"Disabling the Nod Helipads will reduce the number of Apaches found. Disable the Nod Helipad on the northern side of the base.","x":48.21,"y":87.37,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable Western Helipad","pog":"m10_2_06","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"Disabling the Nod Helipads will reduce the number of Apaches found. Destroy the Nod Helipad on the western side of the base.","x":76.33,"y":65.73,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable Southern SAM Site","pog":"m10_2_02","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"GDI air units are having difficulty approaching the southern side of the Nod base. Disable the SAM Site to provide local air superiority for GDI.","x":36.13,"y":38.92,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Destroy Northern SAM Site","pog":"m10_2_02","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"GDI air units are having difficulty approaching the northern side of the Nod base. Disable the SAM Site to provide local air superiority for GDI.","x":48.38,"y":84.84,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable Western SAM Sites","pog":"m10_2_02","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"GDI air units are having difficulty approaching the western side of the Nod base. Disable the SAM Site to provide local air superiority for GDI.","x":79.97,"y":65.09,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable Ea